ELM models for Codex

The generated models.json contains model metadata and instruction templates
derived from OpenAI Codex (https://github.com/openai/codex).
Copyright OpenAI. Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Modifications: intersect upstream model metadata with the ELM inventory; exclude
models using blacklist.json; set use_responses_lite=false for ELM compatibility;
provide generic metadata for eligible models absent from the upstream catalog.
The precise upstream revision and source checksum are in catalog-metadata.json.
